    {
      "id": "1fd56975-5d19-43c6-8f9e-609ad46fed73",
      "name": "📌 Overview – How This Workflow Works",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        144,
        5888
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 2,
        "width": 800,
        "height": 724,
        "content": "## 🧑‍💼 Personal Executive Assistant Agent – Email, Calendar, Slack & Briefing\n\n### How it works\nEvery 15 minutes, a single schedule trigger fires four parallel pipelines that cover your core executive assistant tasks. **Email Triage:** fetches unread Gmail, triages each email with GPT-4o-mini (urgency, sentiment, draft reply), and asks for Slack approval before sending — or saves a draft if no approval is needed, then creates a ClickUp task. **Calendar Conflicts:** reads upcoming events, uses a code node to detect overlapping meetings, and routes to a rescheduling AI agent that proposes alternatives and seeks Slack approval before updating the event. **Slack Mentions:** fetches recent @mentions, triages them with GPT-4o-mini, and either sends a reply directly or requests approval first. **Morning Briefing:** checks if it's 7AM, fetches ClickUp tasks due today, and compiles a GPT-4o-mini briefing sent as both a Gmail email and a Slack message.\n\n### Setup steps\n1. Connect **Gmail OAuth2** to all Gmail nodes.\n2. Connect **Slack OAuth2** (and Slack API) to all Slack nodes — replace `REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_SLACK_CHANNEL_ID` and your user ID in approval nodes.\n3. Connect **Google Calendar OAuth2** to both Calendar nodes.\n4. Connect **OpenAI API** to all four OpenAI Chat Model nodes.\n5. Connect **ClickUp API** to `ClickUp - Create Task from Email` and `ClickUp - Get Tasks Due Today` — replace `REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_CLICKUP_LIST_ID`.\n6. Activate the schedule trigger."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "04c1c85f-5084-4dd1-a0d2-7635da1ad746",
      "name": "Section – Email Triage Pipeline",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1312,
        5792
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1996,
        "height": 840,
        "content": "## 📧 Email Triage Pipeline\nFetches unread Gmail messages, sends each to the Email Triage AI agent (urgency, sentiment, suggested reply). High-priority emails request Slack approval before sending; others are saved as drafts. Either way, a ClickUp task is created to track follow-up."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "352811a6-3d51-44a2-86a9-9c3aeb12a16c",
      "name": "Section – Calendar Conflict Detection & Rescheduling",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1360,
        6656
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1920,
        "height": 568,
        "content": "## 📅 Calendar Conflict Detection & Rescheduling\nReads upcoming calendar events and checks for overlapping time slots in a code node. If conflicts are found, the Reschedule AI agent proposes alternatives. A Slack approval request fires before the calendar event is updated."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "316259ed-e1e0-4f40-a7b9-06647d669b25",
      "name": "Section – Slack Mention Triage",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2016,
        7280
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1744,
        "height": 648,
        "content": "## 💬 Slack Mention Triage\nFetches recent Slack @mentions and passes them to the Slack Triage AI agent, which determines the right response. Low-stakes replies are sent automatically; responses requiring judgment are held for Slack approval before posting."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "f886bab7-3565-4743-9bf8-e00f7b31ca36",
      "name": "Section – Morning Briefing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1136,
        7952
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1380,
        "height": 680,
        "content": "## ☀️ Morning Briefing (7AM)\nChecks whether it's 7AM. If so, fetches all ClickUp tasks due today and sends them to the Briefing AI agent, which compiles a structured daily plan. The briefing is sent simultaneously as a Gmail email and a Slack message."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "a19cbced-5487-4189-9f49-8973763fd6d4",
      "name": "🔑 Credentials & Configuration",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2640,
        8000
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 3,
        "width": 400,
        "height": 344,
        "content": "## 🔑 Credentials Required\n- **Gmail OAuth2** — email fetch, reply, draft, briefing send\n- **Slack OAuth2 + API** — mention fetch, approvals, replies, briefing post\n- **Google Calendar OAuth2** — event fetch + update\n- **OpenAI API** — all four AI agents\n- **ClickUp API** — task creation + today's task fetch"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
